# ============================================================
# 365 WANDERLUST — Environment Variables Example
# Copy this file to .env and fill in values.
# .env is GITIGNORED — NEVER commit it.
# ============================================================

# --- Version 1 (current): WhatsApp-based form, no backend needed ---
# No environment variables required for Version 1.
# All contact details are in src/data/siteData.js

# --- Version 2 (optional, future): Email via Vercel serverless ---
# If you add a /api/contact.js serverless function later,
# store the email API key ONLY as a Vercel environment variable.
# NEVER put it in .env or any frontend file.
# Example key name (add in Vercel dashboard, not here):
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxx
